# libssl3 3.0.20-1~deb12u2 in the debian12-based images (CVE-2026-84782): out-of-bounds read in the
# DTLS handshake retransmission path. It needs a DTLS (datagram TLS) session; ThrillhouseBot speaks
# only TLS over TCP, and does that through the JVM's own JSSE implementation compiled into the native
# binary, which does not load libssl3 at all. Debian fixed it in 3.0.22-1~deb12u2
# (bookworm-security), but gcr.io/distroless/base-debian12 has not been rebuilt with it, and the
# distroless base has no package manager to apply the update. Remove when the distroless base ships
# libssl3 >= 3.0.22-1~deb12u2.
CVE-2026-84782
